Z||000009||Haze_Performance||11-07-2001||06:20 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TRL46202:<BR><B>bump</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Your looking for these wheels right?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Real_Indy_2.jpg"> <P>If so theres bad news... They are not 5x100mm, Pontiac used Camaro rotors for the real Indy. Even if you find them you would have to modify your car to make them fit..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>I looked into this a few months ago (for my Indy). With some help from Oreif, I found the info..<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/reallogo.gif"> <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||9
